

# SmartPredict

### AI-Integrated ERP Supply Chain & Demand Forecasting System

*A decoupled full-stack predictive ERP dashboard that replaces static moving averages with node-specific XGBoost forecasting, EMA target denoising, and Coefficient-of-Variation supplier risk scoring.*
**BSc (Honours) Computing Science Dissertation — University of Stirling (UAE), April 2026**

