## 6. Executive Dashboard Interface (`App.js`)

The React SPA fetches data asynchronously with `useEffect`, triggered on `[category, isAuthenticated]` changes:

```javascript
fetch(`http://127.0.0.1:5000/api/dashboard-data?category=${category}`)
```

State is managed with React Hooks (`useState`, `useEffect`); UI components come from React-Bootstrap, and charts are rendered with Recharts.

### Login page
An authentication gate (`isAuthenticated`) protects access to the dashboard.

> 📸 *Screenshot placeholder:* `docs/screenshots/login.png`

### Tab 1 — Executive Overview
- *Product Node Clarity* definition for the selected node
- *7-Day Demand Prediction* total units (e.g. `197 Units`)
- Automated inventory action badges: `HOLD: Do Not Restock`, `OPTIMAL`, or `CRITICAL`
- Itemized *Predicted Stock Requirements* (e.g. `WWI Desktop PC2.33 X2330 Black: +8 units`)
- *Trending Product Justification*
- Top US locations (e.g. Los Angeles, California; Houston, Texas; New Orleans, Louisiana)

> 📸 *Screenshot placeholder:* `docs/screenshots/executive_overview.png`

### Tab 2 — AI Prediction
- Interactive 7-day line chart: *AI Target Prediction* vs. *Historical Validation*
- Green *Denoised Accuracy (WMAPE)* badge (e.g. `80.6%`)
- *Model Logic* panel showing the percentage weight of each feature of the active node
- Plain-English *AI Accuracy Score Justification*

> 📸 *Screenshot placeholders:* `docs/screenshots/ai_prediction.png`, `Training_Progress.png`, `Feature_Importance.png`

### Tab 3 — Supplier Analysis
- *Supply Provider* (e.g. `Wide World Importers US Logistics`)
- *Calculated Volatility Score* badge (e.g. `0.8`)
- *Supplier Performance Status* badge (e.g. `Medium Risk`)
- Plain-English *AI Calculation* explaining average delivery days and standard-deviation variance

> 📸 *Screenshot placeholder:* `docs/screenshots/supplier_analysis.png`

